hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"27896","Yazid ibn Harun narrated to us: Yahya narrated to us, and Ya'la, he said: Yahya narrated to us, from Bushayr ibn Yasar, from Husayn ibn Mihsan, that an aunt of his came to the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, for a need. She finished her need, so he said to her: Are you married? She said: Yes. He said: Where are you with him? Ya'la said: How are you to him? She said: I do not fall short except what I am unable to. He said: Look where you are with him, for he is your Paradise and your Fire."
